# Upfall Orchard's apple store (CIPlay upfall_orchard_caves, 11-11 w06). Run it in a new world NOT named 'CI ...'
# (e.g. 'W06 ufcaves'): in a 'CI ' world each `island` line empties the inventory, and the machete comes from Altitude
# Market's porter's toolbox first. Points as in the recipe: the mouth in the hill's foot at -22 -18, the cut running
# yaw 215 for 8 m, the vines gate (ufstore_vines) at the mouth, the store room past it round -32.9 -33.6 (the Kristens'
# apple chest). Heights over the island's own water level are guesses: below= keeps the walker on the ground.
island Altitude Market
offset 0 0
open Porter's toolbox
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Upfall Orchard
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines
where Pickup_Landmark_Mushroom
where Pickup_Landmark_DirtPickup

picture uf_cave_out -16.3 6 -9.8 -24.3 4 -21.3
walk -18.6 -13.1 to -20.3 -15.5 to -23.2 -19.6 below=8 blocked
expect shown ufstore_vines
use ufstore_vines
expect hidden ufstore_vines
picture uf_cave_cut -16.3 6 -9.8 -24.3 4 -21.3
walk -20.3 -15.5 to -22 -18 to -24.3 -21.3 to -26.6 -24.6 to -29.4 -28.6 to -31.7 -31.9 below=8
picture uf_cave_in -24.3 5 -21.3 -32.9 4 -33.6 light=20
picture uf_room_back -35.2 5 -36.9 -26.6 4 -24.6 light=20
open Apple store chest
wait 2
expect item Seed_Mango 2
walk -31.7 -31.9 to -29.4 -28.6 to -26.6 -24.6 to -24.3 -21.3 to -22 -18 to -20.3 -15.5 below=8
